Package: BIO215
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Breast Tumor Classification for BIO215
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jia", "Yu", email = "legacccy1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Applies the fixed trained Wisconsin Diagnostic classification model
    used by the BIO215 Shiny application. Validates tabular measurements, returns
    predicted classes or malignant probabilities, and provides exact interventional
    feature contributions on the log-odds scale for the selected ridge model.
    Includes example observations, model provenance and internal evaluation results.
    Intended for reproducible education, not clinical diagnosis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, glmnet, randomForest, e1071
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/legacccy/BIO215,
    https://legacccy.shinyapps.io/bio215-wisconsin-feasibility/
BugReports: https://github.com/legacccy/BIO215/issues
